<div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun, neutral</font></div>Chemie: synthetischer Kautschuk aus Chloropren-Monomeren<div>neoprene</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">neoˈpʁeːnʔanˌt͡suːk</font>/<br>
